  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has no real roots</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> (given)<br />So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
